#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.reduce.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.reduce"
msgstr "cuda.tile.reduce"

#: cuda.tile._stub.reduce:1 of
msgid "Apply custom reduction function along axis."
msgstr "沿指定轴应用自定义归约函数。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.reduce.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.reduce:3 of
msgid ""
"input tile or a tuple of tiles to be reduced. If a tuple is provided, "
"shapes of the tiles in the tuple must be broadcastable to a common shape."
msgstr "要归约的输入 Tile 或 Tile 元组。若提供元组，其中各 Tile 的形状必须可广播到同一个公共形状。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.reduce:5 of
msgid "an integer constant that specifies the axis to reduce along."
msgstr "指定归约操作所在轴的整数常量。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.reduce:7 of
msgid ""
"function for combining two values. If `x` is a single tile, then the "
"function must take two 0d tile arguments and return the combined 0d tile."
" For example, `lambda a, b: a + b` or `operator.add` can be used to "
"implement the sum reduction. If `x` is a tuple of N tiles, then the "
"function takes 2N tiles and returns a tuple of N combined tiles. The "
"first N arguments correspond to one of the groups of values being "
"combined, while the rest correspond to the other."
msgstr ""
"用于合并两个值的函数。如果 ``x`` 是单个 Tile，则该函数必须接收两个零维（0-d）Tile 参数并返回一个合并后的零维 "
"Tile；例如可使用 ``lambda a, b: a + b`` 或 ``operator.add`` 实现求和归约。如果 ``x`` 是包含 "
"N 个 Tile 的元组，则该函数接收 2N 个 Tile 并返回由 N 个合并后 Tile 组成的元组：前 N 个参数对应待合并的一组值，其余 "
"N 个参数对应另一组值。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.reduce:13 of
msgid ""
"a constant scalar or a tuple of constant scalars that specifies the "
"identity element of the `func`."
msgstr "指定 ``func`` 单位元（identity element）的常量标量或常量标量元组。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.reduce:15 of
msgid ""
"True to keep the axis of size 1, False to remove the reduced axis. "
"Default: False."
msgstr "为 True 时保留大小为 1 的归约轴，为 False 时移除该轴。默认值为 False。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.reduce.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: cuda.tile._stub.reduce:19 of
msgid "Reduced tile, or tuple of reduced tiles, depending on the type of `x`."
msgstr "归约后的 Tile 或 Tile 元组，具体取决于 ``x`` 的类型。"

